            "review_text": "han\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n1\nExcellent!\nJul 2020 • Family\nLocated near Eo gio and FLC resorts. Decoration, staffs and menu are good with reasonable price. we ordered the local dishes - \"banh xeo tom nhay\", jellyfish hotpot, dried shrimp spring rolls \"cha ram tom dat\" and some seafood which are very fresh and tasty. They do have a free bus transfer of you are staying at FLC\nWritten July 19, 2020",
